# docs/ : block everything by default, then re-include only the public files.
#   - docs/internal/  : internal engineering docs — NEVER published (kept private permanently).
#     Its own line below is redundant with docs/* but is kept explicit so the intent
#     survives any future reordering of the negations.
#   - docs/internal/リリース作業手順書.md (Store submission + Vector runbook) must
#     never be git add / commit / push, and its contents must not be copied into
#     any tracked file. See .claude/CLAUDE.md.
docs/*
docs/internal/
!docs/CONTRIBUTING.md
!docs/DESIGN.md
!docs/LISTING.md
!docs/MAINTAINING-PUBLIC-DOCS.md
!docs/PLANNED-*.md
!docs/ASSET-EDITOR-VALIDATION-CHECKLIST.md